"releaseNotes":"Thanks for using FamCal!\nThe new version improves the app stability and fixes some minor bugs to help us serve you better.\nWe're glad to hear your feedback. If you have any questions or suggestions please feel free to contact us at famcal@support.beesoft.io.", "version":"8.5.5", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"FamCal: Organize Your Home, Elevate Your Love.\nManage all family chores and schedules in one place.\n\nFEATURES:\n\nFAMILY CALENDAR\n- Share events with the whole family;\n- Keep everyone synced with shared event updates;\n- Set local notifications or notify others via the cloud;\n- Switch between Month, Week, Agenda, and Text Month views;\n- Assign unique colors to each member to view or add events by person.\n  \nSHARED LISTS & TASK DELEGATION\n- Share grocery lists, shopping lists, work schedules, and more;\n- Create task lists and to-dos, then notify a specific member or the whole family;\n- Add dates and times to tasks to remind family members;\n- Print, email your schedule, or export as ICS;\n- Set list visibility to public, private, or shared with select family members.\n  \nSHARED FAMILY MEMOS & SPECIAL DAYS\n- Share notes and jot down every precious moment;\n- Attach photos to capture the moment in your memos;\n- Share and store important contact info;\n- Track Birthdays and Anniversaries;\n- Add comments and chat with family on each memo.\n  \nSHARED FAMILY RECIPE BOX\n- Keep and share all your family recipes in one place;\n- Add ingredients to your shopping list with a single tap;\n- Plan your meals on the calendar with ease;\n- Add recipes manually or import them from a URL;\n- Keep your screen on while cooking with our \"No-Dim\" toggle.\n  \nSHARED TRIP EXPENSES\n- Keep all your family trips in one place;\n- Track every expense throughout your trip;\n- Use detailed charts to analyze all your travel expenses;\n- Export all trip expenses as PDF or CSV files.\n  \nSTAY CONNECTED & IN SYNC\nOrganize your calendar, projects, and notes anywhere, and access them on any device. The whole family shares one account; just log in with your own email address and the shared password.\n\nOne space for your whole crew.\nFamCal isn’t just for families, it’s for any group that needs to stay in sync:\nFor Home: Manage chores and meal plans;\nFor School: Ace group projects and track deadlines;\nFor Life: Log shared expenses and plan trips. \n\nSubscription Information:\n- Weekly and annual subscriptions are available;\n- Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase;\n- Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period;\n- Account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period, and identify the cost of the renewal;\n- Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user's Account Settings after purchase.\n  \nThe content of the screenshots, preview videos, and audio are provided by the following platforms:\n- Shutterstock: Used with permission from Shutterstock.com (where applicable);\n- Epidemic Sound: Touch by Otherguys / provided by Epidemic Sound;\n- Freepik: Designed by Freepik;\n- iStock: Standard license obtained from iStock.\n  \nTerms of Use: http://www.appxy.com/termsofuse\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.famcal.app/privacyPolicy\n\nIf you have any problems or suggestions please send an email to famcal@support.beesoft.io, you’ll get a response as soon as possible.", "userRatingCount":27993}]
